sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant UI as IOCLookup.jsx
  participant APIjs as api.js
  participant RL as rate_limit.py
  participant API as POST /api/ioc/lookup
  participant Cache as ioc_cache
  participant IOC as enrichment/ioc.lookup_ioc
  participant VT as VirusTotal
  participant AIPDB as AbuseIPDB
  participant GN as GreyNoise
  participant MB as MalwareBazaar
  participant UH as URLhaus
  participant OTX as OTX

  User->>UI: submit value + type
  UI->>APIjs: lookupIOC(value, type, greynoise)
  APIjs->>API: POST /api/ioc/lookup
  API->>RL: rate_limit_ioc dependency (token bucket)
  alt over limit
    RL-->>APIjs: 429 + Retry-After
    APIjs-->>UI: throw with detail
  else allowed
    API->>Cache: get_ioc_cache (6h TTL)
    alt cache hit
      Cache-->>API: cached result
      API-->>APIjs: result with cached true
      APIjs-->>UI: cached result
    else cache miss
      API->>IOC: lookup_ioc(...)
      alt type ip
        IOC->>VT: GET ip_addresses
        IOC->>AIPDB: GET check
        opt greynoise true
          IOC->>GN: community lookup
        end
      else type hash
        IOC->>VT: GET files
        IOC->>MB: POST get_info
      else type domain
        IOC->>VT: GET domains
        IOC->>UH: POST host lookup
      end
      IOC->>OTX: lookup_otx_for_ioc (if key set)
      IOC-->>API: merged result
      API->>Cache: set_ioc_cache ON CONFLICT UPDATE
      API-->>APIjs: result with cached false
      APIjs-->>UI: fresh result
    end
  end
  UI->>User: per-source panels + sentences

  Note over UI: On failure (A3/A5): inline error + ref link + retry;<br/>422 validation errors stay inline only (no toast);<br/>notifyApiError for other API failures.
